{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國南方航空公司的國產C919大型客機周一（20日）首次執飛長沙至銀川航線，CZ3925航班於傍晚6時15分載着148名旅客降落銀川河東國際機場。</p><p>該條航線開通進一步加強華中與西北地區交通聯繫，便利兩地商貿往來與旅遊交流。</p><p>（央視新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:39:39.423709+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:12:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:48.856179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:36.472774+00:00","content_hash":"97ed383551b407d5008e0c454811e7f6a3f8dd3470dcb23907f0bce148bb06cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}